   1090  fd16							; 0 ⇔ symmetric (kernel ball block skips; verify_build enforces).
   1091  fd16							; CTRLPF: constant $35 (8-clk ball) — the P2 door 4clk eor ($B5) is
   1092  fd16							; GONE (user 2026-10-12: door must look like the plain async strip;
   1093  fd16							; only the key/bomb semantics differ). One write per VBL is the
