   1132  fd35							; The kernel draws 4 bands, B3RoomBlocks mirrors PF row 2 into row 3, so
   1133  fd35							; the async gate must mirror too or a bottom-band strip vanishes. Phase 2
   1134  fd35							; (LEVEL_FORMAT 7) gives band 3 its own MetaB bit and this goes away.
