   1153  fd3d							; laser follow with zero kernel cost. 64f full cycle = EnemyRamP bit5
   1154  fd3d							; (32 on + 32 off; clock-derived, no state bytes — locked plan).
   1155  fd3d							; --- PhaseBlink ping-pong (chunk A2): it MUST run after the band/ball
   1156  fd3d							; staging above and before the pack below (the crunch walk overwrites
   1157  fd3d							; Temp/BandTab for its cell — running it earlier let SBT's own staging
   1158  fd3d							; erase the crunch mask, and every crunch kill stopped latching).
