   1239  ff59							; FetchPtr = record stream (all same-bank since A3). No field pre-read and
   1240  ff59							; no stack: fields are read at (FetchPtr),base+1..4 as needed. Returns to
   1241  ff59							; HOVnext / HOVlegHit (both pop the .HOVloop base) or HOVafterGate ($80,
